# The agenda: A shows the vault's tasks by day around a pinned today (tests/drive.rs adds
# Inbox/Errands.md and reads the journal back). x ticks a task and it stays, done, where it
# was; ticking the recurring one adds its next occurrence, a week on, under Later. Enter opens
# a task's note at its line, x there unticks it, and Ctrl-o comes back to the agenda as it was.
size 140x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
env COLD_LAVA_TODAY=2026-11-07
wait-for example-vault
keys A
wait-for ↑↓ move · x tick · ⏎ open
expect ▾ Overdue  1
expect Write a note on lahars (Lahar is still unresolved)
expect Thu 5 Nov  2026-11-05
expect ▾ Today · Sat 7 Nov  1
expect ☐ Pay the observatory bill  ⏫
expect ▾ Mon 9 Nov  1
expect Review the eruption timeline board 🔁
expect ▾ Thu 12 Nov  1
expect ▸ Undated  1
expect-not Sort the rock photos
expect 5 rows
screen
keys j x
wait-for done: Write a note on lahars (Lahar is still unresolved)
wait-for ☑ Write a note on lahars
keys j j j j x
wait-for done: Review the eruption timeline board · next occurrence added
wait-for ▾ Later  1
expect Mon 16 Nov  2026-11-05
expect 6 rows
keys G l
wait-for Sort the rock photos
keys /
type photos
wait-for / photos▏
keys enter
wait-for 1 of 6 rows · /photos
keys esc
wait-for 6 rows
screen
keys g j enter
wait-for Journal/2026-11-05  reading
wait-for Ctrl-o ⟵ agenda
keys x
wait-for open again: Write a note on lahars
keys ctrl+o
wait-for ☐ Write a note on lahars
expect ▾ Later  1
keys d
wait-for Agenda · with done tasks
expect ▾ Earlier  2
expect Add the Volcanic Explosivity Index table
screen
keys q q
exits 0
